    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112048" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φον-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>murder, kill,</i>
